{"id":"04ea1c6ff126f884","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-degree.md","title":"Modal Degree and Distinct Box Subformulas","display":"df-modal-degree — Modal Degree and Distinct Box Subformulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-degree","aliases":["89-df-modal-degree"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-modal-degree — Modal Degree and Distinct Box Subformulas","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-subformula]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-degree — Modal Degree and Distinct Box Subformulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 取既有结构递归定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{md}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\omega\">\\(b_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为下面引入的度数和盒子公式计数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{md}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\mathrm{md}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{md}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{md}(A),&amp;\n\\mathrm{md}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\mathrm{md}(A),\\mathrm{md}(B)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{md}(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{md}(A)+1,\\\\\nb_{\\Box}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq|\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\mid\n\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;C=\\Box D\\}|.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{md}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\mathrm{md}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{md}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{md}(A),&amp;\n\\mathrm{md}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\mathrm{md}(A),\\mathrm{md}(B)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{md}(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{md}(A)+1,\\\\\nb_{\\Box}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq|\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\mid\n\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;C=\\Box D\\}|.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 72、105–106、114–116；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>有限语法树递归给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}\">\\(\\mathrm{md}\\)</span> 的存在唯一性；有限子公式集保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{\\Box}\">\\(b_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为自然数。派生联结词先展开。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{\\Box}\">\\(b_{\\Box}\\)</span> 计不同盒子公式，不计重复出现次数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}\">\\(\\mathrm{md}\\)</span> 计一条分支上最多的盒层数。第 8 章的度数上界是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(b_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span>，不保证不动点度数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{md}(A)\\)</span>。本符号不用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(A)\">\\(d(A)\\)</span>，避免与本库 dotted translation 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 冲突。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{md}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{md}(\\bot)&\\coloneqq0,&\\mathrm{md}(p)&\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{md}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{md}(A),&\n\\mathrm{md}(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\mathrm{md}(A),\\mathrm{md}(B)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{md}(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{md}(A)+1,\\\\\nb_{\\Box}(A)&\\coloneqq|\\{C\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\mid\n\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;C=\\Box D\\}|.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{md}","display":false},{"tex":"b_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"b_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{md}","display":false},{"tex":"b_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{md}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"d(A)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false}],"bytes":1628,"backlinks":[{"id":"6d8c3016a32d17f8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9951d1dd53a3ed60","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"94d543cad7d7ee3b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"636cbfa2301b039f","an